<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\城崎家.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Everyone, are you really going to do this?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Don't bring that up now. It's already been decided, hasn't it? Did you lose your nerve?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―That's right. If not now, then when?<PG>
"But...!
{PAUSE ""}
　Everyone's lost their minds after all! Isn't this exactly what the curse-killings are!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―You're wrong. The culprit isn't among us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―That's right. Not one of us is the culprit.<PG>
"Then who are you saying killed them...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―There's one here now, isn't there? That's why we kill.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Don't tell me you're thinking of betraying us?<PG>
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
That's..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―A traitor is the witch's pawn.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―It's all to protect everyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―<STYLE ID="1" RUBY="しろざき">Shirozaki</STYLE>, you too―<PG>
"W-wait!
{PAUSE ""}
　All right... All right, I get it... 
{PAUSE ""}
There's no way I'd betray you..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Can we really trust you?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Of course... You know who was curse-killed after <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-chan</STYLE>, don't you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―............
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―I suppose that's true. Come on, let's go.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸古い.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm sorry, forgive me."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
